{"ref":"BDB, מָסֹ֫רֶת","hw":"מָסֹ֫רֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָסֹ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הַבְּרִית</span> <em>bond of the covenant</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:37\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.37\">Ez 20:37</a> <strong>(</strong>= <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲסֹרֶת</span>; text dub. cf. Lag<sup>GN 1882, 168 f. M 61</sup>; Co reads <span dir=\"rtl\">מוסר</span>, i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּסָר</span> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָסַר\" href=\"/BDB,_יָסַר\", dir=\"rtl\">יסר</a>; so 𝔖<strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, מוֹסֵר","prev":"BDB, אִסָּר"}